 ### Edge Cases and Pitfalls
-*   **Opaque Blocks:** Voxels with `BlocksLight = true` do not receive light from neighbors in Pass 2, nor do they transmit light. They act as barriers [S1, unofficial].
+*   **Opaque Blocks:** Voxels with `BlocksLight = true` do not receive light from neighbors in Pass 2, nor do they transmit light [S1, unofficial].
